        {
          "text": "Pinehasi mwana wa-Eleazara mwana wa-Aroni mupaizi walesya bukali bwangu kubana ba-Israyeli, nkaambo wafwa ibbivwe mbubonya mbuli ibbivwe lyangu, aboobo ndaleka kusyukutya bana ba-Israyeli mubbivwe lyangu. ",
